        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marley Shelton, David M. Evans\n- Films: Grand Canyon, The Sandlot, Pleasantville, Never Been Kissed, Sugar & Spice, Valentine\n- Topics: film debuts, teen-audience films, coming-of-age baseball films\n\nFacts:\n- Marley Shelton made her film debut in \"Grand Canyon\" in 1991.\n- \"The Sandlot\" is a 1993 American coming-of-age baseball film co-written and directed by David M. Evans.\n- \"The Sandlot\" tells the story of a group of young baseball players during the summer of 1962.\n- Marley Shelton appeared in teen-audience films including \"The Sandlot\" in 1993, \"Pleasantville\" in 1998, and \"Never Been Kissed\" in 1999.\n- Marley Shelton appeared in the teen-audience films \"Sugar & Spice\" and \"Valentine\" in 2001.",
